{"code": "class Turnstile:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.state = \"locked\"\n\n    def coin(self):\n        self.state = \"unlocked\"\n        return \"unlocked\"\n\n    def push(self):\n        if self.state == \"unlocked\":\n            self.state = \"locked\"\n            return \"allowed\"\n        return \"denied\"", "text": "```python\nclass Turnstile:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.state = \"locked\"\n\n    def coin(self):\n        self.state = \"unlocked\"\n        return \"unlocked\"\n\n    def push(self):\n        if self.state == \"unlocked\":\n            self.state = \"locked\"\n            return \"allowed\"\n        return \"denied\"\n```"}